<section id="what-is-event-analytics-hub" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="what-is-event-analytics-hub">What is Event Analytics Hub?</h2>
<p>Event Analytics Hub combines two things: written analysis and interactive exploration. Blog posts explain the concepts and show the key findings. Dashboards let you dig into the data yourself.</p>
</section>
<section id="how-the-blog-and-dashboards-connect" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="how-the-blog-and-dashboards-connect">How the Blog and Dashboards Connect</h2>
